                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you've got the space, this is a pretty cool puzzle collection. The production values aren't amazing, and the physics are a bit buggy in places, but the feel of a fixed room-scale environment to walk around and explore different puzzles is really well done and fun. No teleportation mechanic to disrupt the immersion.\n\nThe only major downside is that most of the puzzles are oriented below eye level, so it is really easy to give yourself a neck-ache looking down for long periods of time.",
